# Media files are never text; without this, git's autodetection can treat some
# PNG/WebP files as text and rewrite their bytes (CRLF -> LF), corrupting them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.avif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
